              ['no city has ever reduced its pollution without banning private cars completely', 'This is not a limit. It makes Facet A even stronger, and "no city ever" is too strong.'],
              ['exhaust fumes remain the biggest single threat to public health in cities', 'This supports Facet A. A limit shows where the idea stops working.']
